    "description": "Source: Kobi / Joyce doc feedback, 2026-08-10.\n\nObjective: single Market display field on Deal that combines Market Province/State + Market Country with a country flag emoji, so reps see one field instead of two.\n\nRequested format:\n\n* With state: {country flag emoji} {StateCode} - {CountryCode} e.g. 🇨🇦 ON - CA\n\n* No state: {country flag emoji} {CountryCode} - Multi-state\n\nImplementation: formula field (Market_Display\\__c) driven off Market_Countryc + Market_State_\\_c, with the editable text/picklist fields underneath. Per Kobi's 2026-07-22 rule: 'the main field that is actually editable would be the text version, but then the display version that reps would see, we could append the respective flag.' Reps must never type the emoji.\n\nDependency: BUILD-101 (Market_State__c integrity + retire combined WT_Market values) must land first or in the same change — do not build a display formula on top of drifted data.\n\nRelated: BUILD-78 (consolidated emoji spec).",
    "timetracking": {},
    "attachment": [],
    "summary": "BUILD-118 — Market display field on Deal (flag emoji + state + country)",
